WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120
Today is the day! You've done the hard part.

2
00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:05.920
A few final reminders before you head in.

3
00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:09.860
Stop all clear liquids at least four hours before your procedure time —

4
00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:12.400
nothing to drink after that point, including water.

5
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.100
Continue to avoid solid foods and alcohol.

6
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:19.440
Avoid hard candy, gum, and mints. These count as food and can affect your sedation.

7
00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:22.640
Take a moment to confirm that your output has been running clear —

8
00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:25.200
that's the sign that your prep has done its job.

9
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:28.880
If you're not there yet, please contact your doctor's office before coming in.

10
00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:32.160
Lastly, your driver should also be ready to go.

11
00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:36.000
Your doctor is looking forward to seeing you and taking great care of you today.
